# Proyecto: belentani7__Cruzando-el-charco

Stack detectado: ci, frontend, node, static-html, tests.
Gestores de paquetes: npm.
Tests: playwright.

## Protocolo

1. Spec-first: PRD → SRS → Design Doc → ADR → Plan → tests GWT.
2. Cambios pequeños, reversibles y con verificación real.
3. Conventional commits: `type(scope): summary`.
4. No commitear secretos ni credenciales.
5. No ejecutar TypeScript sin compilar en producción.

## Comandos

- `check`: `node scripts/check-site.mjs`
- `i18n:audit`: `node scripts/i18n-audit.mjs`
- `html:validate`: `html-validate index.html legal.html 404.html`
- `links:check`: `node scripts/check-links.mjs`
- `dom:audit`: `node scripts/dom-audit.mjs`
- `agents:eval`: `node scripts/eval-agents.mjs`
- `agents:report`: `node scripts/eval-agents.mjs --write`
- `static:sync`: `node scripts/sync-static.mjs`
- `browser:audit`: `node scripts/browser-audit.mjs`
- `build`: `node scripts/build-pages.mjs`
- `dist:check`: `node scripts/build-pages.mjs && node scripts/check-dist.mjs`
- `news:update`: `node scripts/update-news.mjs`
- `serve`: `node scripts/serve.mjs`
- `audit:full`: `node scripts/audit-all.mjs`
- `test`: `npm run check && npm run i18n:audit && npm run html:validate && npm run dom:audit && npm run agents:eval && npm run browser:audit`

## Verificación mínima

- Tests del stack en verde.
- Build reproducible.
- `gitleaks detect --source . --redact` limpio.
